{"id":"traje","lemma":"traje","pos":"noun","rank":577,"glosses":["suit","dress (distinctive style for particular occasion)","gown, dress (e.g. bridal gown, evening gown)"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾaxe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"trajes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/32/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-traje.wav","examples":[{"text":"Le traje una muñeca.","en":"I got her a doll.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442623"},{"text":"Todos los trajes de Tom están hechos a medida.","en":"Tom had all of his suits made to order.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806160"},{"text":"Me traje mis herramientas.","en":"I brought my tools.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798028"},{"text":"Los astronautas llevan trajes espaciales.","en":"Astronauts wear spacesuits."},{"text":"Lo traje para ti.","en":"I brought it for you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454235"}]}